 pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">5.1<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 23, 1999<br/>Beta 5.1</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20170922215622&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dark_Shield_86634a.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a dark shield <span class=\"p-attributes\">(Def:33)</span>.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 52.00 oz.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Used by most people when they come from <a href=\"#/wiki/Rookgaard\">Rookgaard</a> because it's so easy to get. Used to be rare, until a quest to get it was implemented. Part of the Dark Set.<br/>\nLooks the same as The Shield Nevermourn.\nReward from the Lighthouse Quest.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-object-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<ul><li>As announced on June 16, 2026, the Vocation Adjustments Update 2026 raised its defense from 25 to 33.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ancient%20Lion%20Knight\">Ancient Lion Knight</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"